<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka's Jan-Feb '97 rubber production lower.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka's Jan-Feb '97 rubber production lower.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's rubber production in the first two months of this year was 3.6 percent lower at 19 million kg against the same period last year, the Central Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said in its latest economic report that rubber output in January-February 1996 was 19.7 million kg.</p>
</text>
